# Design sync (HSK ↔ HTML)

Shared chrome mirrors Harrix-HTML-Template. Visual source of truth: HTML `_variables.scss`.

## Checklist when changing colors / buttons / input chrome

1. Prefer editing HTML `src/scss/_variables.scss` first
2. Mirror in `apps/common/ui_chrome.py`
3. Update both `.cursor/design-tokens.md` files if roles change
4. Update `hsk-ui-chrome.mdc` and HTML `h-brand-colors.mdc`
5. For tracker CTA QSS: edit `window.ui` then regenerate `window.py` with `pyside6-uic`
6. Run `hsk py ruff-sort-docs` and `hsk py check` (respect `.cursor/hsk-py-check.flag`)

## Do not sync

- Caption / Win11 window buttons
- Screenshot overlay `#00AEFF`
- Site navbar / logo layout
- Site TOC left-border selection pattern
